\newlabel{fig:memwalks}{{38}{131}{The five walks of $B$ and of the pair $B,C$ over $1000$ episodes, for one history of each condition (seed $7$). Each walk is divided by the square root of its number of increments. Grey: the $5$--$95\%$ envelope of $200$ honest histories. Dashed: the family-wise boundary}{figure.38}{}}
